{
  "meta": {
    "brand": "Pubbets Workshop",
    "version": "0.3.0",
    "currency": "USD",
    "basePrice": 199.95,
    "note": "v0.3 — tabbed builder with step wizards, ported from the old Pubbets Lab structure. Two UI types: 'grid' (simple list of options) and 'steps' (a wizard over 'dimensions', e.g. nose = shape -> size -> colour). Step options are GENERATED from the dimensions, so you don't hand-write hundreds of rows: the app builds the id and model filename from modelPattern. Upload a .glb matching that name and it appears automatically; until then a placeholder shows. 'view' controls the camera: face = close-up, full = whole body."
  },
